肃","text":"根在淤泥中，花开丽日红。\n洁精无玷污，明月却相融。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8625,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金刚随机无尽颂 其四 能净业障分第十六","author":"释印肃","text":"恶道自销镕，因明智慧通。\n久客还元舍，不离旧家风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8626,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金刚随机无尽颂 其二 善现起请分第二","author":"释印肃","text":"慈尊护念因，旷大劫相亲。\n众生皆我子，岂独出家人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8627,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金刚随机无尽颂 其一 善现起请分第二","author":"释印肃","text":"善吉言初有，乐欲闻初首。\n不堕往来机，中间无所有。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8628,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金刚随机无尽颂 其八 善现起请分第二","author":"释印肃","text":"千古意分明，万国贺升平。\n昨夜泥牛吼，今早木鸡鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8629,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金刚随机无尽颂 其三 善现起请分第二","author":"释印肃","text":"菩提无相貌，凡夫多变豹。\n不落堕野狐，不昧犹成罩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8630,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金刚随机无尽颂 其七 善现起请分第二","author":"释印肃","text":"一堂风冷澹，翠竹笼轩槛。\n夜静松声清，蟾光凝湛湛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8631,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金刚随机无尽颂 其五 尊重正教分第十二","author":"释印肃","text":"随说功尤博，何况精心觉。\n□□无学人，即是大圆觉。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8632,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金刚随机无尽颂 其三 尊重正教分第十二","author":"释印肃","text":"脩罗皆供养，天人咸戴仰。\n不离此经中，念念来还往。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8633,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金刚随机无尽颂 其六 尊重正教分第十二","author":"释印肃","text":"能持行不低，天龙守护伊。\n中涂生告别，拔苦与耕犁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8634,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金刚随机无尽颂 其二 尊重正教分第十二","author":"释印肃","text":"人天幸指迷，初机但受持。\n庵园无滴漏，天晓始方知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8635,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金刚随机无尽颂 其四 尊重正教分第十二","author":"释印肃","text":"塔庙比摩尼，觉了不修持。\n身中真舍利，只恐自狐疑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8636,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金刚随机无尽颂 其七 尊重正教分第十二","author":"释印肃","text":"龙宫盈海藏，金口亲宣唱。\n字字不违贤，个中绝名相。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8637,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金刚随机无尽颂 其七 福智无比分第二十四","author":"释印肃","text":"海门风静夜，满月辽天挂。\n除非知不知，实相凭谁话。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8638,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"畏爱兼抱","author":"释印肃","text":"南山有条鳖鼻蛇，雪峰往日镇常誇。\n丧身失命知多少，满地如今号菜花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8639,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其一 一色","author":"释印肃","text":"枯木岩前差路多，不行鸟道转誵讹。\n狐狸引入豪猪窟，不久成团被死魔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8640,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其二 一色","author":"释印肃","text":"行人到此尽蹉跎，一指头端不奈何。\n毫发有差千万里，沩山抚掌笑呵呵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8641,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其四 一色","author":"释印肃","text":"明月芦花不似他，于中一气逼天罗。\n涅槃影里无相识，鼻孔辽天笑大哥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8642,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其八 一色","author":"释印肃","text":"空里蟾光撮得么，待风列子已蹉跎。\n须弥无缝徒伸手，任是先天不奈何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8643,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其五 一色","author":"释印肃","text":"了了了时无可了，乾坤道我无边表。\n燄摩宫里混金风，兜率殿中明皎皎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8644,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其七 一色","author":"释印肃","text":"慇勤为唱玄中曲，涧水相和音韵足。\n唯有伯牙欲露机，断弦深意无人续。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8645,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其六 一色","author":"释印肃","text":"玄玄玄处亦须呵，喝断乌江返碧波。\n寄语东吴诸父老，不如闻早念弥陀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8646,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其三 心印","author":"释印肃","text":"历劫坦然无异色，东西何立谁南北。\n若言别有一灵光，认子不真元是贼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8647,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其六 心印","author":"释印肃","text":"将喻红炉火里莲，精金百煅转光鲜。\n居尘不染随宜用，始觉松风解说禅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8648,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其七 心印","author":"释印肃","text":"勿谓无心云是道，龟毛兔角非坚宝。\n顽空作境是谁安，不体十方源浩浩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8649,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其五 心印","author":"释印肃","text":"虽知体自虚空性，如理深渊融一镜。\n万象森罗没处藏，摩尼离垢当清净。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8650,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其一 玄机","author":"释印肃","text":"迢迢空劫勿能收，非相非名触处周。\n罔象无心珠自现，何劳汩没外驰求。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8651,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其四 玄机","author":"释印肃","text":"通身何更有踪由，三十年看水牯牛。\n鼻孔无边难摸索，醍醐常纳混春秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8652,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其五 玄机","author":"释印肃","text":"灵然一句超群象，不落圣凡无伎俩。\n长笑一声烟雾宽，含虚寂照亡思想。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8653,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其二 玄机","author":"释印肃","text":"岂与尘机作系留，有为何日得功周。\n除非无我无人见，体用全通得自由。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8654,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其三 玄机","author":"释印肃","text":"妙体本来无处所，超声越色非今古。\n诠题不及议难思，莫怪道吾频作舞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8655,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其八 玄机","author":"释印肃","text":"回程堪作火中牛，一叶才凋万国秋。\n月朗浪平无别事，此心只在朝竿头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8656,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其六 玄机","author":"释印肃","text":"迥出三乘不假修，别传一句普天收。\n扬眉早是相轻忽，妙得无心了便休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8657,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其一 回机","author":"释印肃","text":"涅槃城里尚犹危，亲到灵山未足奇。\n见佛忘知无我所，六根常动转阿弥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8658,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其八 回机","author":"释印肃","text":"再三捞摝始方知，捉影逃形也太痴。\n千眼大悲分得半，维摩老汉始全提。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8659,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其三 回机","author":"释印肃","text":"权挂垢衣云是佛，释迦也似偷空贼。\n忽然捉败不相饶，丹霞火里纯金色。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8660,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其八 尘异","author":"释印肃","text":"莫向如来行处行，一身堕落万寻坑。\n人神百亿扶难起，耳不闻声目似盲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8661,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其一 尘异","author":"释印肃","text":"浊者自浊清自清，一轮坚白不容尘。\n镜中妍丑谁分别，水月融光净法身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8662,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其五 尘异","author":"释印肃","text":"万法泯时全体现，大似金刚经百鍊。\n定光镕烁绝纤埃，只眼圆明何用见。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8663,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其六 尘异","author":"释印肃","text":"三乘分别强安名，悯念群生习气深。\n宝所到时城假化，何曾动步早观音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8664,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其七 达本","author":"释印肃","text":"撒手到家人不识，明朝更不分南北。\n逢场作戏弄孔魂，反指牛儿是弥勒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8665,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其五 达本","author":"释印肃","text":"堪嗟去日颜如玉，常和白云空里宿。\n千回万匝只如然，寥寥独唱无生曲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8666,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其一 达本","author":"释印肃","text":"勿于中路事空王，钻火还须金色光。\n烧却三千并世界，死中得活也无方。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8667,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其八 达本","author":"释印肃","text":"更无一物献尊堂，剔出银盆耀雪霜。\n箭既离弦无退转，洞山收悔不思量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8668,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其六 达本","author":"释印肃","text":"却叹回时鬓似霜，眉毛眼睫放毫光。\n从前无理今皆道，笑指泥途七宝装。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8669,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其二 达本","author":"释印肃","text":"策杖还须远本乡，未曾举足见娘娘。\n多时不隔如今面，子母连天笑一场。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8670,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其四 达本","author":"释印肃","text":"雪山深处我非忘，百一十城印普光。\n弥勒楼开通线道，方知腊雪似春霜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8671,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其六 还源","author":"释印肃","text":"君臣合处正中邪，名相和同体似差。\n一二不成三不是，八还要显我无瑕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8672,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其一 还源","author":"释印肃","text":"返本还源事已差，轻罗不著外寻麻。\n劳虑即真犹未信，忽然解道见桃花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8673,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其二 还源","author":"释印肃","text":"本来无住不名家，唯有西乾路不赊。\n三度他心通败阙，国师犹钓死虾蟆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8674,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其四 还源","author":"释印肃","text":"一带峰峦云更遮，倒骑铁马过流沙。\n东西南北中央佛，共饮乾坤一椀茶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8675,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其七 还源","author":"释印肃","text":"还乡曲调如何唱，蝶拍莺歌大道场。\n唯有禾山解打鼓，金牛作舞也寻常。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8676,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其三 还源","author":"释印肃","text":"万年松径雪深覆，水泄不通无入路。\n解脱门开一步周，喃喃寐语分缁素。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8677,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其八 还源","author":"释印肃","text":"明月堂前枯梅华，太阳门下雪交加。\n宝楼阁里多怪败，达哩摩尼吽发吒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8678,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其一 转位","author":"释印肃","text":"披毛戴角入廛来，水底桃花几度开。\n世界未生唯此性，任他迁变岂轮回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8679,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其六 转位","author":"释印肃","text":"剑树刀山喝使摧，十波罗蜜印灵台。\n光轮无尽奚边表，不是贪嗔根得来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8680,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其四 转位","author":"释印肃","text":"无明山中作云雷，闪电霞光灿不开。\n霹雳一声山岳震，曼拿大士笑咍咍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8681,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其八 转位","author":"释印肃","text":"行于异路且轮回，百亿分身拨不开。\n地狱天堂非别有，相呼相唤隐天台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8682,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其二 转位","author":"释印肃","text":"优钵罗花火里开，方知达磨不虚来。\n夜来一霎清明雨，万卉千葩胜剪裁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8683,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其二 祖意","author":"释印肃","text":"灵机争堕有无功，色空犹未达空空。\n空色本无权立号，无名全体露金风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8684,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其四 祖意","author":"释印肃","text":"十圣那能达此宗，要须历劫道方通。\n饥寒不认灯为火，空守门前草屋中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8685,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其三 祖意","author":"释印肃","text":"三贤尚未明斯旨，羊鹿牛车孩子戏。\n数墨巡行枉用功，假立名为乾慧地。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8686,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其二 演教","author":"释印肃","text":"三世如来共所宣，至今不断少人传。\n塞鸿非是人惊起，风击芦鸣写碧天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8687,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其一 演教","author":"释印肃","text":"三乘次第演金言，义体周天应自连。\n黄叶止啼儿不叫，方知累劫困如眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8688,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其四 演教","author":"释印肃","text":"后谈空有众皆捐，字字无空透色鲜。\n八万法门从此入，如今唤作老婆禅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8689,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其六 演教","author":"释印肃","text":"鹤树终谈理未玄，口中吐露白如莲。\n一花五叶亲分付，只恐众生眼著挛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8690,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂十玄谈 其八 演教","author":"释印肃","text":"阎浮早已八千年，朝夕忙忙被业牵。\n一梦不惊尘劫苦，何如领取现光前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8691,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂三门 其四","author":"释印肃","text":"释达空空遍觉华，到无高下淡浑茶。\n和云假宿烟霞榻，明日东西处处家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8692,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂三门 其一","author":"释印肃","text":"古寺香华迥寂寥，焚修报国化迷流。\n英贤到此须回首，拨草瞻风笑点头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8693,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂三门 其三","author":"释印肃","text":"道人活计若虚空，应物无心世岂同。\n假立化城标宝所，暂时指客怀寰中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8694,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其九十七","author":"释印肃","text":"古人遗意不留言，婆子台山著一边。\n识得台山婆子了，赵州消息没休年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8695,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九十八首 其九十五","author":"释印肃","text":"鱼在岸时活不久，人落深渊当下亡。\n川陆谁知同一性，恰如地狱与天堂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":8696,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]